what: `Validate` — the accumulating (applicative) decoder as an
  algebra on fold+Step: every error, dotted path per error, the typed
  value on success. Laws against `Json.decode`: same verdict on every
  fixture, same value on success, decode's one error among Validate's
  many on failure. Whether `Form.errors` switches to it is decided by
  the UI tests, not assumed — Form's whole-vs-walk rules for options
  and wrappers are pinned behaviour.
